  "content": {
    "id": "p50-q10-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "10",
    "prompt": "A particle is projected from the origin with initial speed $V$ at angle $\\theta$ to the horizontal.\n\nYou may assume the equation of its path is $y=x\\tan\\theta-\\dfrac{gx^2\\sec^2\\theta}{2V^2}$. Use $g=10\\text{ m/s}^2$.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p50-q10-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "Show that the horizontal range is $\\dfrac{V^2\\sin 2\\theta}{g}$.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$R=\\dfrac{V^2\\sin 2\\theta}{g}$.",
          "worked": "At the landing point, $y=0$ and $x>0$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}x\\tan\\theta&=\\frac{gx^2\\sec^2\\theta}{2V^2}\\\\x&=\\frac{2V^2\\tan\\theta}{g\\sec^2\\theta}\\\\x&=\\frac{2V^2\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}{g}\\\\x&=\\frac{V^2\\sin 2\\theta}{g}.\\end{align*}$$\nThus the horizontal range is $\\dfrac{V^2\\sin 2\\theta}{g}$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 35
      },
      {
        "id": "p50-q10-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "If $V=30\\text{ m/s}$ and the range is to be $75\\text{ m}$, find the two possible values of $\\theta$ to 1 decimal place.",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\theta\\approx28.2^\\circ$ or $61.8^\\circ$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{V^2\\sin 2\\theta}{g}&=75\\\\\\frac{900\\sin 2\\theta}{10}&=75\\\\\\sin 2\\theta&=\\frac56.\\end{align*}$$\nFor $0^\\circ<2\\theta<180^\\circ$,\n$$\\begin{align*}2\\theta&=\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac56\\right)\\quad\\text{or}\\quad180^\\circ-\\sin^{-1}\\left(\\frac56\\right)\\\\2\\theta&\\approx56.4^\\circ\\quad\\text{or}\\quad123.6^\\circ\\\\\\theta&\\approx28.2^\\circ\\quad\\text{or}\\quad61.8^\\circ.\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 42
      }
    ]
  },
